OL,3,GNEWSAMother wants justice after boy's
OL,4,A'evil' knife attack on her daughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a 14-year-old girl who
OL,7,Fwas repeatedly stabbed in an "evil"
OL,8,Fattack by a boy says it is disgraceful
OL,9,Fhe was not jailed.
OL,11,FThe boy, 14, from Wiltshire, had
OL,12,Fstalked the girl after she refused to
OL,13,Fdate him before attacking her with a
OL,14,F6in knife at a shop in Cirencester,
OL,15,FGloucestershire, on 15 March.
OL,17,FLast month, he was handed a three-year
OL,18,Frestraining order and a one-year
OL,19,Freferral order after he admitted
OL,20,Fwounding with intent, inflicting
OL,21,Fgrievous bodily harm and possession of
OL,22,Fa bladed article in a public place.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
