OL,3,GNEWSAMother wants justice after boy's
OL,4,A'evil' knife attack on her daughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe girl's mother said: "If it hadn't
OL,7,Fbeen for the shopkeeper and her
OL,8,F[daughter's] quick reactions, she would
OL,9,Fhave been dead."
